  <ThingDef ParentName="AnimalThingBase" ADogSaidBody="LegsTail">
    <defName>RSW_Roggwart</defName>
    <label>roggwart</label>
    <description>Roggwarts were large, predatory beasts with sizeable populations on the planets Mustafar, Vendaxa, and Guiteica. These creatures were incredibly heat resistant and had an aggressive nature. Typically, only those taken from the most young of age are able to be trained as pets or guardians. Roggwarts were a favorite pet of the Kaleesh warriors and thus populations were able to establish themselves on many worlds in Wild Space as a consequence of the movements of these warrior peoples.</description>
